    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>JVM MethodParameters attribute.</para><para>The MethodParameters attribute is a variable-length attribute in the attributes table of a method_info structure (4.6). <ref refid="classA" kindref="compound">A</ref> MethodParameters attribute records information about the formal parameters of a method, such as their names. See section 4.7.24 of the JVM specification. </para>    </detaileddescription>
